    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d387">

                <pb facs="0440" n="1174" xml:id="pg1174"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Armstrong to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September 7,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have delayed answering note of minister for foreign affairs awaiting any
                    comments from you on telegram giving contents of said note. In your telegram of
                    24th ultimo you use expression, “$1,500,000 in Spanish gold pesos.” Spanish
                    minister expresses it as “1,500,000 Spanish gold pesos.” I await your comments
                    upon this difference of words. Otherwise, entire agreement between your telegram
                    and note of minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armstrong</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
